<title>UK: Citibank sets warrants on dollar/Swiss franc.</title>
<headline>Citibank sets warrants on dollar/Swiss franc.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Citibank NA has issued six million call and put warrants, in six equal tranches, on the U.S. dollar/Swiss franc rate, lead manager Citibank (Switzerland) said.</p>
<p> WARRANTS	STRIKE	ISS PRICE</p>
<p> PUT A	   1.35 CHF     6.23 CHF</p>
<p> CALL B	  1.40 CHF     5.85 CHF</p>
<p> PUT C	   1.40 CHF     9.00 CHF</p>
<p> CALL D	  1.45 CHF     3.95 CHF</p>
<p> PUT E	   1.45 CHF    12.30 CHF</p>
<p> CALL F	  1.50 CHF     2.60 CHF</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   16.MAR.98		 PAYDATE	06.FEB.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   =			   MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  1.4203 CHF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
